From 38d09da63d92d8a2759323e424f37259b0a470ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 20 Jan 2022 18:32:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-69581] common: remove global conf hdr from common code

Including device specific headers from common code is not allowed
anymore, and instead the device structures should be used.
Common code is refactored to use device structure instead of
psoc_global_conf header.

Change-Id: I7edadb33445fe53ea097b18f796078b38bc9d0a3
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

